  "batch": "6063ab33-f65b-4bfd-b270-8ccea0bd7d15",
  "caveats": "Each ZIP download contains the original scanned TIFF files for a single calendar\nyear, including monthly and dekadal scans. The files are provided in a ZIP archive\nto preserve the original sources and may be extracted and converted as needed.\n\n\nThe data may require interpretation with its building blocks such as the vegetation,\nsoil moisture or rainfall to fully place the cause of the drought, highly dependent\non the data source, in this case SPI, soil moisture anomaly and vegetation anomaly\nwhich may vary depending with number of weather stations sharing data on a geographic location.",
